<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lower and lower, dear Savior, we pray,</l><l>Losing the self-life still more every day;</l><l>Weak and unworthy, we’re looking above:</l><l>Empty us wholly; then fill us with love.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lower and lower; yet higher we rise</l><l>Lifted in Christ, freed from all the earth ties:</l><l>Humbly we follow the way of the cross.</l><l>Then, crowns of glory, and gain for all loss.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
